<title>USA: Jos. A Bank Clothiers Inc Q4 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Jos. A Bank Clothiers Inc Q4 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPSTEAD, Md. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	    $47.1	$44.6     + 5.6	+ 5.9</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $155.1     $143.5     + 8.1	+ 9.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.  </p>
<p>NOTE: Results exclude operations from women's clothing lines, which were liquidated and discontinued in 1995.</p>
